    "title": "Lane Closure Notice - Hudson Road - NewsBreak",
    "text": "cedarfalls.com\nwebsite\nCedar Falls\nLane Closure Notice - Hudson Road\n1 days ago\nBeginning Thursday, July 31, 2025, the contractor will begin the reconstruction of the sanitary sewer along the Hudson frontage road. In order for this work to begin a lane closure is needed on the outside, southbound lane of Hudson Road. The lane closure will be in effect for approximately eight (8) weeks, depending on weather. Below is a map for reference.",
